---
const install = "npm install @agentallowance/sdk @stellar/stellar-sdk";
---

<section class="docs-home-hero">
  <div class="docs-home-status">
    <span><i></i> SDK v0.1.1</span>
    <span>STELLAR TESTNET</span>
    <span>x402 v2</span>
  </div>
  <p class="docs-home-kicker">DEVELOPER DOCUMENTATION</p>
  <h1>Bounded payments for autonomous agents.</h1>
  <p class="docs-home-lead">
    Give an AI agent a budget, recipient scope, token, rolling window, and expiry without giving it
    your treasury key. AgentAllowance enforces the rule on a Stellar smart account and settles the
    approved x402 payment with verifiable evidence.
  </p>
  <div class="docs-home-actions">
    <a class="docs-primary-action" href="/getting-started/quickstart/">Start building <span>-&gt;</span></a>
    <a class="docs-secondary-action" href="https://agentallowance-console.onrender.com/">Open live dApp <span>-&gt;</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="docs-install" aria-label="SDK installation command">
    <span class="docs-install-prompt">$</span>
    <code>{install}</code>
    <button type="button" data-copy-install aria-label="Copy installation command">COPY</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="docs-proof-strip" aria-label="Verified capabilities">
  <div><strong>209</strong><span>verification checks</span></div>
  <div><strong>4</strong><span>public npm packages</span></div>
  <div><strong>0.01 USDC</strong><span>proven x402 settlement</span></div>
  <div><strong>2</strong><span>policy denials proven</span></div>
</section>

<section class="docs-paths">
  <div class="docs-section-heading">
    <p>CHOOSE A PATH</p>
    <h2>Go from idea to a bounded payment.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="docs-path-grid">
    <a href="/getting-started/quickstart/">
      <span>01 / QUICKSTART</span>
      <h3>Make the first payment</h3>
      <p>Install the SDK, configure a delegated signer, and unlock an x402-protected resource.</p>
      <b>5 minute guide -&gt;</b>
    </a>
    <a href="/guides/freighter/">
      <span>02 / WALLET OWNER</span>
      <h3>Create an allowance</h3>
      <p>Use Freighter to deploy a treasury and sign an exact create or revoke operation.</p>
      <b>Wallet integration -&gt;</b>
    </a>
    <a href="/guides/merchant-facilitator/">
      <span>03 / INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
      <h3>Accept agent payments</h3>
      <p>Issue x402 challenges and verify smart-account policy evidence before settlement.</p>
      <b>Integration guide -&gt;</b>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="docs-flow-section">
  <div class="docs-section-heading">
    <p>THE PAYMENT PATH</p>
    <h2>Every approval is narrow. Every denial is final.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="docs-flow" aria-label="AgentAllowance payment flow">
    <div><span>01</span><strong>HTTP 402</strong><small>Merchant returns exact terms</small></div>
    <i></i>
    <div><span>02</span><strong>Authorize</strong><small>Agent signs one invocation</small></div>
    <i></i>
    <div><span>03</span><strong>Enforce</strong><small>Smart account checks policy</small></div>
    <i></i>
    <div><span>04</span><strong>Settle</strong><small>Facilitator returns receipt</small></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-copy-install]");
  button?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText("npm install @agentallowance/sdk @stellar/stellar-sdk");
    button.textContent = "COPIED";
    window.setTimeout(() => { button.textContent = "COPY"; }, 1200);
  });
</script>
